WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
The accessories haven’t been replaced yet

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,420
Just adjusted a few parameters

3
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,220
Try it and see which one works better than before.

4
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:10,410
If there's anything you don't like, just come down, mom.

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,810
Their two A-class mechas

6
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:12,810
Can we start making it?

7
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,410
There are still several A-level elective subjects that can be tested in these two days.

8
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,810
The formal mecha master in Jijiu District

9
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,010
Also gave me a lot of inspiration

10
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:22,010
Wait for me to adjust the drawing, your design

11
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:23,410
I will also draw it again

12
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:24,810
The procedures are just different

13
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,010
A few sentences will get you to the point

14
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:27,810
I was on the field looking at its mecha.

15
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,410
I really didn’t expect it to be so awesome

16
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:30,810
Nowadays it’s not just about cross-machine mechas

17
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:31,810
Some schools do not recommend using it

18
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,610
Or you can ask it directly for materials that are difficult to access.

19
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:35,610
It's like having an extra teacher here

20
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:37,610
Didn't you say that the mecha hit me? Let me help you take a look.

21
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,190
There is another competitive match before the holiday

22
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:42,190
When shall we try again?

23
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,790
It won’t work if the first three days of the holiday fall on a Saturday.

24
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:48,390
Let's wait until next semester when we come back and fight again. Agreed why?

25
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,580
Last time it was just a small probability event

26
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,580
You won’t encounter the major level every time

27
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,380
Those are the days when you fall into old habits

28
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,580
Wouldn't it be uncomfortable?
